{"id":"96d58aa7b6884a9b","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-computable-real.md","title":"可计算实数与一致实值函数","display":"df-computable-real — 可计算实数与一致实值函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-computable-real","aliases":["43-df-computable-real"],"display":"df-computable-real — 可计算实数与一致实值函数","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§8.1, print pp.132–135 / PDF pp.152–155","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-computable-real"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-computable-real</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-real — 可计算实数与一致实值函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§8.1, print pp.132–135 / PDF pp.152–155"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为具有固定有效编码和可判定代码集的可数域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:D\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f:D\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>。有理数输出按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a> 理解；所量化近似函数全定义于声明的域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ComputableReal}(r)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(k)-r|\\le2^{-k}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ComputableReal}(r)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(k)-r|\\le2^{-k}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists q:D\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(x,k)-f(x)|\\le2^{-k}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists q:D\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(x,k)-f(x)|\\le2^{-k}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一致可计算实值函数适用于柱集概率、鞅等；机器输出有理近似而非任意实数的无限精度值。</p>\n<p>来源：§8.1, print pp.132–135 / PDF pp.152–155。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$r\\in\\mathbb R$；$D$ 为具有固定有效编码和可判定代码集的可数域，$f:D\\to\\mathbb R$。有理数输出按 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 理解；所量化近似函数全定义于声明的域。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"f:D\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ComputableReal}(r)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(k)-r|\\le2^{-k}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists q:D\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(x,k)-f(x)|\\le2^{-k}).","display":true}],"bytes":1411,"backlinks":[{"id":"bda505ba94a2dc32","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Gale}_s$、$\\mathrm{Success}^s$ 见 [[43-df-sgale]]、[[43-df-sgale-success]]。$\\mathrm{UniformComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-real]]，用于有限串编码上的实值函数。"},{"id":"16634b9fc07ef245","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $M:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}$，$\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}$；$\\mathrm{Computable}(M)$ 是离散部分可计算性（see [[43-df-computable]]），$\\mathrm{PrefixFree}$、$\\mathrm{ComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-prefixfree]]、[[43-df-computable-real]]。约定 $\\min\\varnothing=+\\infty$；对任意部分函数，$\\Omega_M$ 的非负级数先在 $[0,+\\infty]$ 中求和，计算性条件另以有限实数见证表达。"},{"id":"6cfc6a383edf25e5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$